{%- comment -%}
  Section separator in the embroidery stroke: one thin wavy line across the whole width of
  its container. Decorative: aria-hidden. PLACEHOLDER ARTWORK, like the motifs, until the
  designer delivers the real one.

  The line is stretched to the container width (preserveAspectRatio="none") and every
  shape is vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke", so stretching never changes the 2px weight.
  Color is currentColor: the caller sets it with a token.

  Parameters:
    class  (optional) extra classes.

  Usage:
    <div style="color: var(--color-ink-muted)">{% render 'embroidery-divider' %}</div>
{%- endcomment -%}

<svg
  class="embroidery-divider{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}"
  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
  width="100%"
  height="12"
  viewBox="0 0 386 12"
  preserveAspectRatio="none"
  fill="none"
  stroke="currentColor"
  stroke-width="2"
  stroke-linecap="round"
  stroke-linejoin="round"
  aria-hidden="true"
  focusable="false"
  style="display: block;"
>
  <path
    d="M1 6 q12 -6 24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0 t24 0"
    vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"
  />
</svg>
